TI  - The Strategic Role of AI in Business Digital Transformation: Opportunities
      and Challenges
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025
PB  - Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.
AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) has emerged as a central catalyst in the
      digital transformation process, reshaping business strategies, operational
      models, and customer interactions. By enabling automation, advanced data
      analytics, and intelligent decision-making, AI provides organizations with
      novel ways to innovate and enhance competitiveness. Nonetheless,
      significant challenges remain. These include ethical and legal
      considerations, data governance issues, and the need to upskill workforces
      to fully harness AI's potential. This paper examines the strategic
      importance of AI in business digital transformation, tracing its
      evolution, presenting real-world use cases, and evaluating the key
      enablers and barriers to sustainable AI -driven growth. We also propose a
      framework that organizations can use to integrate AI responsibly, striking
      a balance between competitiveness and ethical considerations. © 2025 IEEE.
