AB  - This chapter explores the intersection of AI and cyber laws, focusing on
      the challenges and opportunities of AI in cybersecurity. It defines AI and
      its growing significance in the digital age, emphasizing the importance of
      understanding AI within the cybersecurity context. The chapter traces the
      historical development of cyber laws, analyzing how AI has influenced
      their evolution and the correlation between AI technologies and cyber
      laws. It examines AI applications in cybersecurity, such as threat
      detection, automated incident response, and predictive analytics, while
      addressing legal and regulatory challenges like algorithmic transparency,
      accountability, privacy, and jurisdictional issues. Ethical considerations
      and privacy concerns are also discussed, highlighting the need to balance
      security and privacy. The chapter predicts future trends and innovations
      in AI and cybersecurity, concluding with recommendations for policymakers,
      cybersecurity professionals, and researchers. © 2025, IGI Global
      Scientific Publishing.
