TY  - JOUR
AU  - Berman, A
AU  - de Fine Licht, K
AU  - Carlsson, V
AD  - Centre for Linguistic Theory and Studies in Probability (CLASP),
      Department of Philosophy, Linguistics and Theory of Science, University of
