AB  - This chapter examines the transformative role of artificial intelligence
      (AI) across various sectors, focusing on its impact on financial decision-
      making, business analytics, and risk management. It highlights how AI
      technologies, such as machine learning and predictive modeling, are
      enhancing decision- making accuracy and operational efficiency in
      financial sectors and supply chain management. The study also explores
      AI’s influence in emerging economies, driving economic growth and
      innovation despite challenges. Additionally, it addresses ethical
      considerations, including data privacy and the need for Explainable AI
      (XAI) to ensure transparency and trust. The chapter underscores AI’s
      potential to reshape industries and improve decision- making processes
      while navigating its inherent challenges. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific
      Publishing. All rights reserved.
