AB  - This chapter explores the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) into
      social media marketing, highlighting how machine learning, predictive
      analytics, and natural language processing are transforming customer
      engagement, content personalization, and campaign management. The chapter
      examines AI-driven tools such as chatbots, sentiment analysis, and
      automation platforms that enable marketers to deliver targeted and
      responsive communications at scale. It also addresses ethical concerns
      related to data privacy, algorithmic transparency, and consumer trust.
      Drawing on recent case studies and industry trends, this chapter provides
      insights into how organizations can leverage AI to enhance brand
      visibility, optimize user experiences, and make data-informed marketing
      decisions. Finally, the discussion concludes by identifying future
      directions in AI-enhanced marketing strategies and their implications for
      digital advertising ecosystems. © 2026 by IGI Global Scientific
      Publishing. All rights reserved.
