TI  - An Intelligent Blockchain Integrated Deep Learning Framework for Detection
      and Predictive Analysis of Early Neurodegenerative Disorder Diagnosis
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026
PB  - Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.
AB  - The early diagnosis of neurodegenerative diseases is essential in
      enhancing patient health but has been limited by the complications in
      neurological patterns and maintaining medical data management. This paper
      proposed Intelligent Blockchain-Integrated Deep Learning Framework to
      detect and predict neurodegenerative diseases in their early stages. It is
      a multimodal framework, which gives the benefit of convolutional neural
      network (CNN) combined with Bidirectional to extract the multimodal
      biomedical data. Privacy and interoperability issues are resolved by
      incorporating a blockchain-based decentralized architecture, which would
      guarantee reliable data exchange, integrity among healthcare
      organizations. Moreover, an Explainable AI (XAI) mechanism which doctors
      can use for personalized treatment and preventive care. Experiments with
      benchmark datasets indicate that the proposed system has high accuracy has
      low false detection rates, and better model transparency. The study builds
      a strong base of a smart, secure healthcare ecosystem which can support
      early diagnosis, data integrity and predictive healthcare innovation. ©
      2026 IEEE.
