TI  - A Trustworthy Human-Centered AI Design Conceptual Framework
T2  - Int. J. Adv. Sci. Eng. Inf. Technol.
JF  - International Journal on Advanced Science, Engineering and Information Technology
VL  - 16
IS  - 4
SP  - 1343-1353
PY  - 2026
