TI  - ARM-AI: A HUMAN-CENTRED FRAMEWORK FOR AI-ASSISTED RISK MANAGEMENT IN AGILE
      SOFTWARE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT
T2  - Int. J. Mechatron. Appl. Mech.
