AB  - This chapter explores the integration of federated learning, explainable
      artificial intelligence (XAI), digital twins, and Metaverse technologies
      to transform modern healthcare systems. Digital twins enable real-time
      patient modeling and predictive analysis, while federated learning ensures
      privacy-preserving collaboration across medical institutions. Explainable
      AI enhances transparency and clinical trust by making intelligent
      decisions interpretable. The Metaverse further extends these capabilities
      by enabling immersive visualization, remote collaboration, and interactive
      medical training. Together, these technologies form a secure, intelligent,
      and patient-centric healthcare ecosystem that supports personalized
      treatment, ethical AI deployment, and future-ready digital healthcare
      innovation. Copyright © 2026, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. Copying or
      distributing in print or electronic forms without written permission of
      IGI Global Scientific Publishing is prohibited. Use of this chapter to
      train generative artificial intelligence (AI) technologies is expressly
      prohibited. The publisher reserves all rights to license its use for
      generative AI training and machine learning model development.
