AB  - Integrating Machine Learning (ML) into modern threat intelligence enhances
      organizational readiness against cyber threats. ML utilizes data analysis
      and predictive analytics to detect and mitigate threats effectively. ML's
      deep learning techniques detect anomalies and deviations from normal
      system behavior, aiding in threat prevention. However, challenges such as
      data quality issues and privacy concerns exist. Addressing these
      challenges through Explainable AI and advanced behavioral analytics can
      improve ML's transparency and effectiveness in cybersecurity.
      Organizations should leverage ML in cyber threat intelligence for
      automated risk identification and response. © 2025 IEEE.
