AB  - This e-book explores the strategic convergence of Artificial Intelligence
      (AI), Digital Twins, and the Metaverse as the foundational triad driving
      Industry 5.0. Emphasizing human-centric, sustainable, and adaptive
      technologies, it highlights how AI empowers real-time analytics,
      predictive maintenance, immersive environments, and intelligent
      decision-making. Digital Twins enable dynamic simulations of physical
      systems, while the Metaverse facilitates interactive and collaborative
      virtual experiences across industries. The book discusses AI techniques
      such as machine learning, deep learning, computer vision, and natural
      language processing, and examines their applications in smart
      manufacturing, healthcare, retail, and urban planning. It also addresses
      ethical considerations, data governance, and future trends including
      explainable AI and federated learning. Together, these technologies
      redefine how businesses innovate, operate, and engage in an increasingly
      intelligent and interconnected digital economy. Copyright © 2026, IGI
      Global Scientific Publishing. Copying or distributing in print or
      electronic forms without written permission of IGI Global Scientific
      Publishing is prohibited. Use of this chapter to train generative
      artificial intelligence (AI) technologies is expressly prohibited. The
      publisher reserves all rights to license its use for generative AI
      training and machine learning model development.
