TI  - EXPLAINABLE AI FOR COMPUTER SCIENCE INSTRUCTORS: ENHANCING TEACHING AND
      PROFESSIONAL PRACTICE
T2  - 22nd International Conference Mobile Learning and 11th Educational
      Technologies, ML ICEduTech 2026
