TI  - 5 Challenges and Limitations of AI Adoption in Banking: Strategies for
      Overcoming Obstacles
T2  - Future Trends in AI Banking: Decentralized Finance (DeFi), Central Bank
      Digital Currencies (CBDCs), and Beyond
SP  - 57-76
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026
PB  - River Publishers
AB  - Future Trends in AI Banking: Decentralized Finance (DeFi), Central Bank
      Digital Currencies (CBDCs), and Beyond offers an in-depth, forward-looking
      exploration of how artificial intelligence is reshaping the financial
      sector—from retail and private banking to global markets and digital
      currencies. As technology accelerates faster than regulation and tradition
      can keep pace, this book provides a clear, structured analysis of where
      finance is headed and how AI can help create a smarter, more inclusive
      system for all. Organized into four sections, the book begins with a deep
      dive into the key technologies driving transformation, including machine
      learning, blockchain, and data analytics. It explains how these
      innovations are redefining customer behaviour, automating decision-making,
      and influencing behavioural finance—particularly in areas such as
      retirement planning and financial literacy. The second section turns to
      the real world, presenting case studies and data-driven insights from
      private banking and other financial institutions. Readers will gain a
      realistic understanding of AI’s potential and its current limitations,
      from the challenges of integration to issues of transparency, trust, and
      governance. The third section explores the evolving nature of money
      itself, highlighting the rise of central bank digital currencies (CBDCs)
      and how AI can support responsible innovation, ESG-aligned investment
      strategies, and sustainable growth. Privacy, regulation, and the social
      responsibilities of AI-driven finance are examined in depth. Finally, the
      book closes with ethical and strategic reflections on the future of
      intelligent banking—addressing not just what AI can do, but what it should
      do. By blending technical insight with ethical foresight, Future Trends in
      AI Banking: Decentralized Finance (DeFi), Central Bank Digital Currencies
      (CBDCs), and Beyond equips professionals, policymakers, and academics with
      the understanding needed to navigate the next wave of financial
      innovation.
