TI  - Assessing the Effectiveness of Student Advice Recommender Agent (SARA):
      the Case of Automated Personalized Feedback
T2  - Int. J. Artif. Intell. Educ.
JF  - International Journal of Artificial Intelligence in Education
VL  - 31
