TI  - Adaptive Learning through Moodle: Empowering Personalized Education
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025
PB  - Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.
AB  - This paper presents the design, implementation, and evaluation of Exam
      Buddy, an intelligent Moodle plugin that uses data-driven methods to
      deliver personalized learning. The system employs a rule-based analysis
      engine to process student assignment data, identifies individual knowledge
      gaps, and automatically recommends tailored learning resources. We
      deployed the plugin in a real-world classroom study with Grade 10 ICT
      students. A comparative analysis between an experimental group (plugin
      users) and a control group (nonusers) revealed a statistically significant
      improvement in academic performance for the experimental group (p < 0.05).
      Furthermore, the system reduced teacher workload in resource selection by
      83% and received strongly positive feedback on student engagement. This
      study demonstrates the efficacy of embedding lightweight AI-driven
      personalization within mainstream Learning Management Systems (LMS) to
      enhance educational outcomes and operational efficiency. We also discuss
      the path towards a more sophisticated ML-based adaptive engine.. © 2025
      IEEE.
