PB  - IEEE Computer Society
AB  - The rapid expansion of K-12 education has created an unprecedented demand
      for personalized tutoring resources, with traditional educational support
      systems struggling to meet the diverse needs of millions of students. This
      paper presents QuizWhiz, a comprehensive AI-powered educational platform
      that addresses critical limitations in existing educational technology
      solutions. Unlike traditional question-bank-based applications that merely
      provide answers, or general-purpose AI models that lack educational
      context optimization, QuizWhiz integrates a specialized fine-tuned large
      language model with an end-to-end educational framework. The platform
      features three core modules: an intelligent learning assistant system for
      students, an AI-powered dialogue interface for iterative learning, and a
      data-driven analytics dashboard for teachers. The system processes
      multi-modal educational content through advanced problem-solving language
      models that generate structured explanations, and provides real-time
      learning analytics, creating a closed-loop educational ecosystem that
      benefits both students and teachers. Additionally, through supervised
      fine-tuning on a self-constructed dataset of 11,000 high-quality K-12 Q&A
      pairs, our customized model QuizWhiz-K12 achieves a 70.01% accuracy rate
      on the Chinese K12 benchmark, representing a 4.84% relative improvement
      over the base model. The QuizWhiz-K12 is publically available at
      https://github.com/YChaiyi/LLM-QuizWhiz-k12-v2. © 2025 IEEE.
