AB  - Emerging technologies are transforming language education by offering
      personalized, adaptive, and data-driven learning experiences. Natural
      Language Processing (NLP) enables the development of intelligent language
      tools such as chatbots, automated feedback systems, and pronunciation
      analyzers, which support learners in acquiring linguistic skills
      efficiently. Learning analytics harness student interaction data to
      monitor progress, identify learning gaps, and inform targeted
      interventions, enhancing both teaching effectiveness and learner outcomes.
      Intelligent Tutoring Systems (ITS) provide adaptive scaffolding,
      individualized instruction, and real-time feedback, promoting active
      engagement and self-directed learning. The integration of these
      technologies fosters a learner-centered environment, supports diverse
      learning styles, and facilitates the acquisition of communicative
      competence across cultural and linguistic contexts. Copyright ©2026, IGI
