TI  - PrajaSetu: A Unified AI-Driven Digital Governance Platform for Secure
      Voting, Transparent Administration, Tax Management, and Civic Empowerment
SP  - 1-7
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026
AB  - PrajaSetu is a comprehensive, AI-enabled, multilingual governance platform
      that unifies secure digital voting, transparent government data access,
      automated tax management, and citizen engagement into a single scalable
      ecosystem. Designed in alignment with the Digital India vision, PrajaSetu
      aims to strengthen democratic participation, transparency, and digital
      trust. The system integrates biometric liveness verification using
      MediaPipe, Blockchain-based vote integrity, and AI-driven analytics for
      governance tracking and civic service optimization.The platform’s modular
      architecture is structured into interlinked components: (1) secure voter
      registration and biometric authentication, (2) encrypted vote casting and
      Blockchain validation, (3) real-time election result visualization, (4)
      transparent data access for policies and projects, (5) integrated tax
      filing and payment automation, and (6) AI-assisted citizen support. Built
      using React, Python, TensorFlow.js, and a zero-trust security model,
      PrajaSetu ensures both usability and resilience.This paper presents an
      in-depth description of architecture, algorithms, security protocol
      designs, evaluation on prototype deployments, extensive user-study
      feedback, and policy considerations. Prototype testing demonstrates 98.2%
      biometric verification accuracy, robust FAR ≤ 1.3%, and consistent
      sub-2-second front-end response times under simulated election loads —
      indicating the platform’s readiness for controlled field pilots.
